Package: @source_basename@-config-@version@
Meta-Rules-Target: config
Architecture: linux-any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.linux.nosource>
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: @source_basename@-source-@version@
Description: Intel optimized kernel configurations for Linux @version@
 This package contains the configuration files optimized for Intel
 platforms, used to build Linux @version@ kernel packages with Intel-specific
 features and optimizations.
 .
 These configurations are tailored for Intel hardware and can be used as
 a basis for configuring custom kernels for Intel platforms.
